--- !u!114 &1543516294
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1543516291}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb8b9b8972307094fb6fc82a1338dde1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Tutorial
  dialogueParent: {fileID: 1540056739}
  instCustomer: {fileID: 973448600}
  cupboardInv: {fileID: 264813759}
  pcInv: {fileID: 1930462342}
  currentStateType: 0
  startLines:
  - Hello, dear Hazel!
  - This is a test for the Tutotial State Machine.
  - Do not panic, sweetheart. I will explain the basic controlls for you.
  - Move with WASD or Left Stick.
  - And look with MOUSE or Right Stick.
  customerLines:
  - Great!
  - Now go to speak with the customer.
  - Interact with Left Click or the South Btn.
  bookMenuLines:
  - Okay, now, open the recipes book by interacting with it.
  - (Use Left Click or South Btn.)
  materialsLines:
  - Right, right. So much information.
  - Look for the recipe of the potion our dear client asked for.
  - Afterwards, go to the cupboard and interact with it.
  minigameLines:
  - Mmhm... Okay.
  - Now, select the item you want to use based on the recipe you just saw.
  - Firstly, take it, and put it in the barrel, near the cauldron.
  - Secondly, use the Cursor (Maintain) or Left Stick to move the spoon.
  endOrderLines:
  - Yippe! Potion made! *cheerfull sounds*
  - Now, take that MERAVELOUS potion and give it to the customer.
  pcLines:
  - Uff... What a busy day, wasn't it?
  - For last, you will need to interact with your PC.
  randomEventsLines:
  - Okay, in here you will order the materials needed for the next day.
  - Take into account you will encounter many things.
  - 'Such as:'
  - A Merchant.
  - Price Variations.
  - And many more to come!
  - Finish your day and go to sleep, sweety. You've earned it.
